Job Number: 50027
Department: Education Bureau
Division/Section/Unit: Special Education Division
Job Title: Part-time Educational Psychologist (EDB/SE/126/26)
Salary: $484 per hour (Required to work not more than 16 hours per week)
Entry Requirements: (a) A Hong Kong bachelor's degree in Psychology, or equivalent;
(b) A certificate in education from Hong Kong tertiary educational institution, or equivalent;
(c) A Hong Kong Master's degree in Educational Psychology (Professional Practice), or equivalent;
(d) Met the language proficiency requirements of Level 2 or above in Chinese Language and English Language in the Hong Kong Diploma of Secondary Education Examination (HKDSEE) or the Hong Kong Certificate of Education Examination (HKCEE), or equivalent;
(e) A minimum of 6 years relevant experience after obtaining qualification (a) above, of which at least 3 years as an Educational Psychologist in an educational setting after obtaining qualification (c) above;
(f) Good communication, interpersonal, analytical and organizational skills; and
(g) Ability to work independently and as a team.
Note: (i) Applicants without a certificate in education before the date of appointment may also apply. If selected, they will be appointed at a lower salary than that stipulated in the advertisement as determined individually by the Education Bureau.
(ii) For appointment purpose, 'Grade C' and 'Grade E' in Chinese Language and English Language (Syllabus B) in the HKCEE before 2007 are accepted administratively as comparable to 'Level 3' and 'Level 2' respectively in Chinese Language and English Language in the 2007 HKCEE and henceforth.
